# Link holds no credentials.
#
# Each system issues its own access token through its own OAuth flow, the
# browser keeps them for the session, and Link forwards them on the
# `x-source-tokens` header. There is nothing to put here, and nothing to copy:
# the README tells you to copy the two portals' files and not this one. It is
# kept so the next variable Link needs has somewhere obvious to go.
